Talk-group voice announcement clips
===================================

The Ogg-Opus files in this directory (tg_01.opus … tg_05.opus, spoken
"talk group one" … "talk group five") are text-to-speech audio synthesized
with the Piper neural TTS voice "en_US-libritts_r-medium".

