Regenerating
------------

Run tools/gen-announce-clips.sh with Piper on PATH and the voice model at
$HOME/.local/share/piper/en_US-libritts_r-medium.onnx (override with
PIPER_VOICE). If Piper is unavailable the script falls back to espeak-ng for
development only — do not ship espeak-ng output; it is not the licensed voice
this NOTICE describes.
